# Actuator Reviewer Rule v1.0 STRICT

**Do not inline-audit.** Invoke **`actuator_reviewer`** → `.cursor/agents/actuator_reviewer.md`.

**One Resolution per finding.** Five rows: Pattern, Mechanism, Security property, Prohibited, Verify. Rules: **SKILL.md §5.2** + **§6.1** + catalog **§6**. **Only Evidence** may quote source code.

## Policy (fixed)

| Endpoint | Web | Auth |
|---|---|---|
| health | Allowed | None |
| info | Allowed | Required |
| **All others** | **Forbidden** | Remove from exposure — red flag |

**POLICY.md wins.**

