## Invoke when

Actuator or `management.*` config changes, security matcher changes on Actuator paths, or pre-deploy. Skip `target/`, `build/`, docs-only edits.

## Stack gate

**SKILL.md §1.1** before CHECK-IDs. On fail → **§1.2** report only; no scored findings.

